---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Hilko: software, mathematics and projects.">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm {SITE.author}</h1>
      <p class="lede">I write software and mathematics, and I like making both easier to understand.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        My book
        <a href="/book/"><em>From Pythagoras to Riemann–Roch</em></a> is a problem-first companion to
        algebraic geometry. On this site I also showcase some smaller projects such as a GPU fractal explorer, a visual canvas for Python, a tag-based
        organiser and a swipeable argument for collective action (still in progress).
      </p>
      <p>
        I care about tools that respect their users: no tracking cookies, no lock-in, source code
        in the open. This site follows the same rules. It counts page views with GoatCounter,
        which stores no personal data.
      </p>
      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Code: <a href={SITE.github}>github.com/hilkoc</a></li>
        <li>Support my work: <a href={SITE.donate}>Buy me a coffee</a></li>
        <li>Send me a message: <a href="/contact/">contact form</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
